        "subject": "feat(portal): store choices fill the row; a copy button per receiving number; a styled upload button; Send and Cancel centred",
        "body": "feat(portal): store choices fill the row; a copy button per receiving number; a styled upload button; Send and Cancel centred\n\nOwner, 2026-11-12: one store fills the row, two split it, three use thirds; a phone stacks them. Each receiving number (shown as 36 96 38 39, without +222) has its own copy button - named for screen readers, keyboard-usable, outside the choice - that copies the eight digits as the server lists them and says Copied. The screenshot is chosen with a real button that names the file (drag and drop left out: it does not work on phones). The payer's own number stays international.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
